Subject: [PATCH 09475/11362] Trajectory supervisor for the live agent, default
 off (REQ-ARC-WMTE-6600)

Adapts the supervisor from NVIDIA's AVO harness (arXiv 2603.24517) to a
weak local generator. Detection is mechanical: a window of actions with
no level-up. The redirect is a closed decision table over existing
levers: drop the goal bias, reset the induction latch, or switch the
explorer to its randomized draw. Each arm fires at most once per level.
Every redirect writes a receipt. No LLM call. Env-gated, default off.

Includes the freshness-lint rebuild of the early-stop sweep artifact:
0 measurement values changed; only run metadata and the agent-code hash
moved. The two prior hand-added rebuild notes were restored by hand.

